      "sourceTextSha256": "ff45049d5dea77a44025743a8fd08d2e71757ca0f5fd5d2990cf1c6eaf80a711",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel.\n\nDeparture crossing the salt flat from north to south. Continuation along the volcanic range towards the Lípez region. View of the Ollagüe Volcano in the distance.\n\nEntrance to Eduardo Avaroa National Reserve. Visit of the lagoons of Cañapa, Hedionda and Honda, where different species of Andean flamingos can be observed.\n\nArrival to the Siloli Desert.\n\nAccommodation at Desert Hotel & Overnight.",
