    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "db2646bd59f03b88396dc9cad1d841f3c1e6dc925f4d049ed19bfedcc7c03cf8",
      "text": "Early breakfast (around 06:30 am).\n\nVisit of the Stone Tree rock formation. Continuation to Laguna Colorada, an important nesting site for flamingos. Visit of Sol de Mañana geysers to observe volcanic activity, followed by a stop at Polques hot springs.\n\nContinuation to the Dalí Desert and visit of Laguna Verde located at the foot of the Licancabur Volcano.\n\nReturn to Uyuni via the Valley of the Rocks and visit of San Cristóbal village. Arrival in Uyuni at approximately 18:00.\n\nAccommodation at hotel in Uyuni & Overnight.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "139nvt1nXNhubAnOXPH1YDOpcBsyaxHqz",
